        {
          "text": "Nasi ndaleebuusilia omukuhani omwisiikwa, owitsa okhukholanga akawinjana nende akali mumwoyo kwanje nende mumapaaro kanje; khandi ndalamuumbashila inzu iralilu; naye aleechendelesinjia imbeli wamasihi wanje obushia nobushia. ",
          "type": "text",
